{"text": "He remembered the Great Famine of his childhood, the terrible winter in which his own mother had died. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That summer the salmon had not come up the rivers, and in winter the caribou did not come either. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The dogs grew so thin that they were nothing but bones, and when spring came at last, not one person in ten was still alive. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also remembered a winter day when he and Zing ha, his boyhood friend, found strange tracks on a frozen creek. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Zing ha, who later became the cleverest of hunters, would one day fall through a hole in the ice of the Yukon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But on that day he was only a boy, and it was he who read the story written in the snow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were the tracks of an old moose and, close beside them, the tracks of many wolves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Zing ha said that the moose was too old to keep up with its herd and that the wolves had cut it off. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also said that the wolves would never leave such a moose until the end. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If the moose had stayed close to its herd, it would have been much safer, but now it had to fight alone.", "alignment": {"characters": ["H", "e", " ", "r", "e", "m", "e", "m", "b", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "G", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "F", "a", "m", "i", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "h", "o", "o", "d", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "e", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "t", "e", "r", " ", "i", "n", " ", "w", "h", "i", "c", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "m", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "d", "i", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "u", "m", "m", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "l", "m", "o", "n